as both exciting  when a remake was announced for 2021 and  a shame when the game was delayed to  2022 and then indefinitely delayed due  to the war in Ukraine for those who  haven't played Advanced Wars the game is  a super simple turn-based grid strategy  game similar in many ways to Fire Emblem  however instead of leveling up specific  units you'll be capturing bases and  using finances to purchase them with  each Commander you can control having  specific abilities that can turn the  ties of battle while the gameplay is  deceptively simple it's one of those  perfect strategy games where it's easy  to learn but takes time and skill to  master hopefully we'll see a 2023  release of the reboot  speaking of fantastic grid-based  strategy games a brand new Fire Emblem  Fire Emblem engage is on its way to the  Nintendo switch Fire Emblem was nearly  on its way out before Fire Emblem  Awakening and breathed new life into the  series on the Nintendo 3DS then in 2019  Fire Emblem saw the excellent Fire  Emblem 3 houses which went on to become  the best-selling Fire Emblem game in the  franchise Fire Emblem engage has its own  interesting concept and the player being  able to utilize Fire Emblem Heroes of  the past to help them fight including  the likes of Marth and one of the  greatest Fire Emblem characters of all  time lindis at the very least making an  appearance Fire Emblem 7 is the best  Fire Emblem fight me Fire Emblem engage  is set to release January 20 2023  while we're here in turn-based Grid  strategy land it seems like 2023 will be  a great year for fans of this style of  game Metal Slug tactics which was  initially set to be released in 2022 was  delayed and now set to release in 2023  snk's Metal Slug games were known for  their fantastic and fun artwork as well  as brutal difficulty they were arcade  coin-eating beat em up games that were a  whole ton of fun and Metal Slug tactics  seems to capture that same artistic  energy but in the tactics genre that  said it's unclear if the game will  maintain the brutal difficulty of their  predecessors however if you want a brand  new Tactical experience this is  definitely something worth keeping an  eye out for Metal Slug tactics has no  set release date but currently is  supposed to release sometime in 2023  if there's one game series that didn't  see enough spin-offs or sequels it was  Jet Set Radio the Fantastic Dreamcast  game spawned one single sequel just at  Radio Future before the series sadly  hung up its futuristic rollerblades  however the year is 2023 and a spiritual  successor from Team reptile by the name  of bomb Rush cyberfunk is on its way how  much of a spiritual successor is it well  not only does it look visually in  gameplay wise incredibly similar to Jet  Set Radio games but the team even  managed to secure a number of tracks  from Legendary game composer Hideki  naganuma naganuma wrote the incredibly  funky and fresh song ain't nothing like  a funky beat for the team's former game  lethal League Blaze and is back at it  with another hot track in get enough for  bomb rush cyberfunk so get ready to  grind your way through the dopest Game  of the Year in summer 2023  octopath traveler released exclusively  on the switch back in 2018 before  eventually coming to PC and Xbox One  it's gorgeous HD 2D Graphics have since  become a new staple of Square Enix and  were utilized in games like live a Liv's  remake and triangle strategy it also has  an absolutely beautiful soundtrack  octopath traveler 2 features a brand new  world from the first game with 8 new  characters and 8 new stories I'm  personally hoping they intertwine a  little more than the first game but any  RPG fan should be overjoyed to see a new  octopath coming out octopath traveler is  set to release February 24 2023  in pepper grinder you'll take control of  pepper a drill wielding treasure hunter  who's been Shipwrecked and robbed the  gameplay has you drilling through the  environment at quick speeds collecting  treasure and solving puzzles you'll be  able to use these Treasures to upgrade  pepper and your drill the game looks to  be a fun fast-paced game with a great  system of movement and it's one that I'm  personally looking forward to pepper  grinder releases sometime in 2023  if games like unravel or It Takes Two or  up your alley you just may be into Blanc  an upcoming Co-op Adventure game where  players control either a wolf cub or  Fawn who have been stranded in a  snowstorm the two players will have to  work together to navigate through  obstacles in this absolutely adorable  animal Adventure block releases February  14 2023 just in time for Valentine's Day  just saying  all right so admittedly this one may not  be coming out in 2023 but we can all  hope way back in 2017 it was announced  that Metroid Prime 4 was in development  and since then there have only been  minor updates with it being revealed in  2019 that developments had restarted  under Retro Studios this same Studio  behind the original Metroid Prime while  Metroid fans got to scratch that 2D  exploration itch with Metroid dread in  2021 the Prime series is its own  wonderful and unique thing and the last  game we saw was released way back in  2007 so here's to hoping that 2023 is  the year of Metroid Prime 4.  as I alluded to in the intro The Legend  of Zelda tears of the kingdom is the  hotly anticipated sequel to breath of  the wild since the release of breath of  the wild the game has become such a  beloved game in Mainstay it's difficult  to find open world games that haven't at  least been somewhat influenced by it or  at the very least compared to it fairly  or not while the breath of the wild  sequel was teased to come out far sooner  as breath of the wild release in 2017  and tears of the kingdom is using the  same engine to our understanding six  years later we're finally seeing tears  of the kingdom come to fruition and it's  those six years that makes tears of the  Kingdom stand out even more Zelda games  are known for their high quality and the  fact that the team takes how much time  it seems to need to create some of  Gaming's most stunning and memorable  games whether it completely reinvents  the wheel with a breath of the wild or  iterates in fantastic ways a la Majora's  Mask so here's the hoping tears of the  kingdom is the Majora's Mask the breath  of the wild a game that takes the  foundation of breath of the wild but  iterates in fantastic new ways I know  this sounds overwhelmingly positive for  a game that hasn't been released yet but  Nintendo rarely lets this Zelda fan Down  The Legend of Zelda tears of the kingdom  is set to release May 12 2023.  and there you have just some of the best  switch games coming out in 2023 was  there anything we missed let us know in  the comments and I'll see you next time
 

